{"entryId":"1191","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:1191:1","sourceSha256":"e2c96c5fc993a10039c4ce1089c4576b85159aaa7c8c322a6b83bae3e01e1ee6","englishSha256":"70c14314b6239e9a5421bbd68b4b0f869a4e00d3dd99b7d07b72085867178d96","citations":[{"id":"1191:1:citation-01","he":[30,74],"en":[63,83],"target":{"url":"https://he.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=זהר_חלק_ג_קנח_א&oldid=3025847"},"reference":"Zohar III 158a","assessment":"Saved Shelach text has Chaggai sent by Babylonian sages to learn from Rabbi Shimon and other colleagues. Its interlocutors are Chizkiyah and Yisa; Heilprin transmits Yose.","evidence":[{"reference":"Zohar III 158a","target":{"url":"https://he.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=זהר_חלק_ג_קנח_א&oldid=3025847"},"witness":"Hebrew Wikisource revision 3025847"},{"reference":"Zohar III 158a","target":{"url":"https://he.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=זהר_חלק_ג_קנח_א&oldid=3025847"},"witness":"Hebrew Wikisource revision 3025847"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[0],"holds":[{"raw":"ופגעו בו ר' חזקי' ור' יוסי","reason":"The named Zohar witness reads Chizkiyah and Yisa. Preserve the compiler’s Yose.","evidence":[{"reference":"Zohar III 158a","target":{"url":"https://he.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=זהר_חלק_ג_קנח_א&oldid=3025847"},"witness":"Hebrew Wikisource revision 3025847"}]}],"notes":[{"text":"The exact Shelach narrative is at Zohar III 158a. The compiler’s Yose stands beside Yisa in the saved witness.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Zohar III 158a","target":{"url":"https://he.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=זהר_חלק_ג_קנח_א&oldid=3025847"},"witness":"Hebrew Wikisource revision 3025847"},{"reference":"Zohar III 158a","target":{"url":"https://he.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=זהר_חלק_ג_קנח_א&oldid=3025847"},"witness":"Hebrew Wikisource revision 3025847"}]}],"entryEvidence":[]}
